feat(config): conductor as default build, planner replaces plan + per-agent model overrides

- New 'config' hook: replaces opencode's built-in build/plan agents
  - conductor.md prompt -> agent.build (mode primary, default agent)
  - planner.md prompt -> agent.plan (mode primary)
  - coder/reviewer/mapper/scout registered as subagents
- New .smol/smol.json: per-agent model + variant overrides
  - String shorthand: { coder: 'openai/gpt-5' }
  - Object form: { conductor: { model, variant } }
  - Variant passes through to opencode AgentConfig (extra field)
- install CLI now skips conductor.md and planner.md, removes stale copies
- Smol commands updated to target build (auto) and plan (plan)
- 9 new tests (parseAgentMd + runConfig + smol.json overrides)

